{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4edd6545-3f53-87c5-bd32-44cd8596c638",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T11:21:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a streetlight that's acting up on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 3 Bridge Street, down in the Point. The light just flickers on and off all night. Like, on, off, on, off, the whole night. It's wicked distracting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it the pole right at the curb out front, or the one further down toward the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one right out front, by the curb. Closest to my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And has it been doing this for a while, or is it new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, maybe a week, week and a half. It was fine and then it started with the flickering. I'd really like a crew to come check the pole, see if it's the bulb or the wiring or whatever it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at it. Anything else you noticed, like a buzzing sound, or does it go out completely for stretches?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goes out completely for a bit, then comes back. No buzzing that I can hear. Sorry, I'm kind of in the car, I just came from the bank. I cashed a check and the line took ages, like forty minutes, so I'm just getting to this now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a long wait for a Thursday morning. Well, I've got the address. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0170, and your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kwame Singh. S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:20:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kwame. So that's the streetlight in front of 3 Bridge Street, flickering on and off overnight, crew to check the pole. It's in the system now. Streetlight repairs usually get done within a week or two, depending on what they find."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That works. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:21:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
